OL,3,GNEWSAMusic video highlights violence
OL,4,Aagainst women
OL,5,
OL,6,F"We can never get to a point where
OL,7,Fwe're talking too much about it," says
OL,8,Fsinger-songwriter Daisy Foster about
OL,9,Fthe issue of violence against women and
OL,10,Fgirls.
OL,12,FThe 23-year-old from Broadstairs, Kent,
OL,13,Fhas produced a music video for the song
OL,14,Fshe wrote after she was attacked by a
OL,15,Fman when walking on a street with
OL,16,Ffriends.
OL,18,FThe video for SWaN, Safety for Women at
OL,19,FNight, will be shown at an event in
OL,20,FRamsgate, bringing together charities,
OL,21,Fpoliticians and stakeholders.
OL,23,APub: 24-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
